      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "After the 1988 Seoul Olympics, Dongdaemun Stadium was abandoned and later became a bustling market before its redevelopment.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dongdaemun_Design_Plaza",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Heunginjimun Gate, built in the 1390s and rebuilt in the 1860s, lies just a five‑minute walk from the DDP.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
