      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2009 the city announced the Dongdaemun History & Culture Park to preserve excavated remains and showcase Seoul’s heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
